        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ntemi Yoashi kūfunya shilagīlo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoashi aho alandya kūtema walī na myaka mpungatī, ūsuga ikanza lya myaka makūmi anè alī mu Yelusalemu. Ū nina walī muna Beeli-sheba, ī lina lyakwe witanagwa Zibia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoashi walī ntūngīlīja ū kūlī SEEBA, pyī ī myaka īyo ngabīji Yehoyada walīho mpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoyada ūmpandīkīla bakīma babīlī ūtoola ūbyaala bitūnja na bashīke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikanza ilebe ū Yoashi ūbona gīkī īlī yawiza kwībeegeleja ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA ūmo yalī yakambagūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūbitana pye a bagabīji na a Balawī; ūbawīla, “Jagi hose hose ū mu mizengo ya Yuda, ng'ūjikuminga ī hela ījo jikafunyiagwa na Baisilaeli būlī ng'waka kūlwa kwībeegeleja ī hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu wing'we; nīyo kangīlījagi ū kūgwīta ū nīmo gwenūyo.” Alīyo a Balawī batandije wangū ū kwīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū ntemi ūng'witana ū ngabīji ntaale Yehoyada ūmūja, “Nibūlī ūtūūbakomelejaga a Balawī ū kūjeenha ī hela ja goodi kūfuma ī Yuda nī Yelusalemu; ī goodi īyo yalagījiwa na Musa ntūmami o ng'wa SEEBA kūlwa kūlībeegeleja ī liheema lya būkaanīji, na a Baisilaeli a bose būzunya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikanza ilebe a bitūnja ba nkīma wa malofu ū Asalia bakīkambūla hanhū ī hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu, bingīla moi būshisola ī shiseme ī sheela; būyūshitūmamīla na mu myatīla ya kūgalamya Mabaalī!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hekalu kūbeegelejiwa chiza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūlagīja lyūbeejiwa isandīko lyūtūūlwa hanze, ha mita gwa hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a banhū ba Yuda nī Yelusalemu būkomelejiwa kūng'wenhela ū SEEBA ī goodi īyo Musa ntūmami o ng'wa Mulungu walī walagīja na kūbakomeleja a Baisilaeli aho balī kwitogolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a batūmami na a banhū a bose bandya kūsooga na būyegi, būyūtūūla ū ng'wisandīko kūshisha lyookala pa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Balawī balyenhaga ng'hangala ningī ī lisandīko ū kū batūmami ba ntemi, ūlū babona gīkī jilī ningī moi ī hela, wizaga ū kalani wa ntemi nū ntūmami wa ngabīji ntaale bajisola ī hela ū ng'wisandīko, hūna balīshosha hangī ī lyoi ūko likalaga. Jikakwīla ī shikū bakūgwītaga ū mhayo gwenūyo, kūshisha būbilinga hela ningī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi nū Yehoyada būyūbinha a banhū abo bagūbeejaga ū nīmo gwa kwībeegeleja ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. Būyūbinha baselemala na bazengi kūlwa kwībeegeleja ī hekalu, na bakoolī mu milīmo ya chūma na shaba kūlwa kwībeeja chiza ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū abo bagwīmīīlaga ū nīmo baalī basanyiwa, na lūūlū gwajaga chiza; yūūzengwa būpya ī hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu, yūdaama, yūshoka ūmo yalī ī kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bagūmala ū nīmo, ī hela ījo jikasaaga būjitwala kūlī ntemi na Yehoyada; jūūbeejiwa shiseme sha kūtūmamīla mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. Shiseme sha milīmo ya kūlamīja, na ya kūfunīja shitambò sha kūpemvwa, na mabbakuli na shiseme shingī sha zahabu na sha feza. Ū mu shikū jose ja būlamu bo ng'wa Yehoyada, ī shitambò sha kūpemvwa shafunyiagwa gwa gwa gwa ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū Yehoyada walī wanamhaala, nose lyūshika ī likanza lya kūcha kwakwe, ūcha namhala wa myaka mingī, igana na makūmi adatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūjīkwa mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi hamò na batemi, nguno ya wiza ūbo walī wabīītīla a Baisilaeli, nī yīyo walī wīyīta kūlwa ng'wa Mulungu nī hekalu yakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgwa kwa ng'wa Yoashi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoyada aho waacha, batūmami ba būsugi wa mu sī ya Yuda biza kūnangamīla ū ntemi; ūbadegeleka īyo bīhayaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbiza bīleka ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji babo; bandya kūlamya makīngī ga Maashela na shiikolile shingī shingī; na lūūlū kūlwa būhūbi wabo wenūbo, ū būpelanu bo ng'wa Mulungu wīyikīīla ī Yuda nī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nūūlū īkī ū SEEBA wabatūmīlaga a banhū bahangi kūlwa kūbakaanīla gīkī banyamuke bangalūkīle, alīyo naheene batabadegelekile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna Moyo o ng'wa Mulungu ūng'wikīīla Zakalia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoyada, ūyo walī ngabīji. Wīmīīla ū kū būtongi wa banhū ūhaya, “Ū Mulungu alīhaya gīkī, ‘Nibūlī mulīshikenaagūla ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA? Ītūbeela ī mihayo ying'we; na lūūlū īkī ng'wanekile ū SEEBA, nū wei wamulekile a bing'we.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo būnīīla gwīnda yabūbi, būmponda mawe kūlwa shilagīlo sha ntemi būmūlagīla ha gwaalugwa ya hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Yoashi atizūkilwe ū wiza ūbo Yehoyada ū ise o ng'wa Zakalia walī wang'wītīla; ūmūlaga ū ng'witūnja wakwe. Ū munhū ng'wenūyo aho alambalalile alī ng'wikanza lya kūcha ūhaya, “Ū SEEBA ni agūbonage ū mhayo gwenūyū, agūmalīle shiilī wei.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoashi kūpyenwa na kūbūlagwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu makanza ga kūjīlīīla kū būkalīkījo bo ng'waka, ibità lya Baalamu būng'ūbūkīla ū Yoashi; bīdumīla ī Yuda nī Yelusalemu būbabūlaga pye a basugi ba banhū; būsola shikolo shingī no, būshitwala Damasiko kūlī ntemi wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū īkī a Baalamu baalī biza na banhū bageehu dūhū, alīyo ū SEEBA ūbinha mu makono gabo ibità itaale no. Nguno ī Yuda yalī yaneka ū SEEBA ū Mulugu wa bakūlūgenji babo; na lūūlū ū Yoashi ūgwisījiwa nsango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baalamu aho balīnga, būneka ū Yoashi walabūkaga kībi no; hanuma ya henaho batūmami ba mu būsugi bokwe būnsīīga bizunīlīja mu mbisīla kūnkenaagūla kūlwa nguno walī wamūlaga ū ng'witūnja wa ngabīji Yehoyada. Na lūūlū būmūlagīla mu būlīīlī bokwe; aho waacha ūjīkwa mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi; gwike atajīkilwe hamò na a batemi a bangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
